# BLSS net provenance (docs/neural-upscaler.md). Written beside the net
# it describes; the net's own bytes carry only magic + net-version, so
# everything here is what a consumer needs to know that a net which
# LOADS is also the right net. No timestamp and no editor version on
# purpose - re-running `command` must reproduce this file byte for byte.
blss-provenance 1
net-version 3
features 6
hidden 12
outputs 3
tile 32
act-table 512
scale 2x2
jitter 0
sharpen 0.5
frames 660
shots 55
epochs 400
seed 0xB1557
corpus examples/upscaler-lab examples/material-lab examples/endless-runner examples/cube examples/save-points examples/procedural examples/endless-scroller bestiary
command tyrax-editor --blss-train examples/upscaler-lab examples/material-lab examples/endless-runner examples/cube examples/save-points examples/procedural examples/endless-scroller bestiary --all-shots --frames 660 --no-jitter -o resources/blss-default.net
